1326	Amanda Blackmore		Below you will find log in details for you to take a MiRo psychometric assessment to support the Marketing Team Development Session on 11th April.  I would be grateful if you would complete this by close of business on Friday 1 April.\r\n \r\nMIRo is a psychometric profiling tool which looks at behavioural preferences and characteristics in order to help us to understand the dynamics at work in group interactions. This understanding and improved awareness can enable teams to consciously create their own environment for success. \r\n\r\nThere is no right or wrong answer and so when taking the assessment, just try to be as honest as you can and go with your instinct. \r\n \r\nTo get started please click on the link below, enter the supplied user name and password into the appropriate fields and follow the online instructions. Remember both user name and password are case sensitive and some log in problems are caused by people mistaking 0's (zero's) for (letter) O's so best simply to copy and paste, ensuring you don't include any extraneous spaces.\r\n \r\nThe whole assessment should take no more than 10 minutes or so.\r\n \r\nIf you have any questions please do not hesitate to get in touch.\r\n\r\nKind regards\r\n\r\nAndy\r\n\r\n\r\n07747601594	1	65537	2016-03-18 09:43:33.954	2016-04-15 08:26:25.961	1	9651	9651	MiRo Psychometric - Pse complete by Fri 1 Apr ready for the Apr Team Development Session.	NA	Y
