473	Business Loyalty - Emma Ferries	Meeting Room 4 NT2 Booked	On 13th August I will be attending your team meeting to facilitate a day based around self development.\r\n\r\nIn order to break through the mysteries of preference and help you continue the journey of self development for effective performance we will be using a tool called MiRo Behavioural Assessment.\r\n\r\nMiRo is an easy way to understand how we view the world and the way that this influences our motivations, fears and styles of communication.\r\n\r\nTo communicate, connect & adapt more effectively we firstly need to understand ourselves, and MiRo can help. \r\n\r\nTo start this journey, you will need to complete the online questionnaire in order for me to raise the reports we will be using when we get together.\r\n\r\nIf you could complete the online questionnaire by midday on Wednesday 11th August it would be greatly appreciated as this gives enough time to get the reports compiled and produced - Thank you.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to seeing you soon…\r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nSimon Charlton\r\nTalent Partner - Sales & Loyalty\r\nTalent & Development	1	53213	2010-08-06 12:12:41.781	2010-08-06 12:40:40.092	1	4015	4015	Friday 13th August - MiRo	\N	N
484	SAM 6th Sep Darlo	Room Booked - G2M5	We told you not so long ago that we created a 'getting the edge' program where we would be delivering a number of initiatives under this umbrella where the first initiative will be all about looking in the 'MiRo'.\r\n\r\nThe 'MiRo' behavioural workshops have been designed specifically to be used in the modern workplace. It's not a therapeutic tool nor is it intended to save the world. It's designed to help people work better and smarter. It is essentially a way to help you better understand yourself and others. It also gives you the tools to challenge your perceptions, the way you make decisions and engage with others. \r\n\r\nThat means better communication, better team work and better leadership. MiRo can help you to make the most of what you have and it can help teams and organisations make the most of their people.\r\n\r\nI am pleased to announce that you have been invited to a look in the 'MiRo' workshop of which further details will follow shortly. \r\n\r\nTo start this journey, you will need to complete the online questionnaire in order for me to raise the reports we will be using when we get together.\r\n\r\nYour username and password is at the foot of this email - Please look for your off-line slot which Rebecca will be scheduling for you soon.\r\n\r\nThank you and looking forward to seeing you soon.\r\n\r\nSimon Charlton\r\nTalent Partner\r\nTalent & Development - Sales & Loyalty\r\n07890753707	1	53456	2010-08-26 11:31:01.839	2010-08-26 12:42:32.429	1	4015	4015	Getting the Edge - A look in the 'MiRo'	\N	N
