947	Hospice Fundraising Team		Welcome to the first part of your Communication Skills Workshop being facilitated by CPD. It was great to meet you earlier this week and I hope I was able to take away any anxieties you may have about the MiRo Psychometric.\r\n\r\nMiRo Behavioural Mode Assessment, to give it its full name, is a tool that will give you an opportunity to develop your self awareness by reflecting on the behaviours that you habitually prefer. I will go through the model in the MiRo workshop on 26th March. If you would like an appointment to discuss your individual profile in detail, following the workshop, I would be more than happy to arrange this.\r\n\r\nTo get started simply click the link below and copy and paste your user name and password into the appropriate boxes. Then just follow the onscreen instructions. The questionnaire will take about 20-30 minutes to complete and a dictionary may be handy. Please complete it as soon as possible. During our workshop we will also explore a team map which will plot each person's outline results (not the detail of the report) onto a team diagram. This will aid the further development of your team as you discover what drives each team member.\r\n\r\nThere is no right or wrong answer and so I encourage you not to dwell too long on the questions but to go with your initial reaction. I also encourage you to be completely honest in your answers. \r\n\r\nIt is my experience that sometimes people ask, "I am to reflect on my personal or my professional life?" Although in practice there isn't much difference in the outcome for this assessment, I would ask you to think about your professional life as you answer these questions. \r\n\r\nIf you have any questions about the completion of the assessment please give me a call.\r\n\r\nKind regards, \r\nMark\r\n	1	60823	2014-02-06 15:59:02.116	2014-02-06 15:59:02.116	1	3911	3911	Your MiRo Questionnaire	N/A	N
