395	Sales Activity Management SMT	Alex Ketteringham\r\nPaul Edney\r\nKatherine Wilson-Reed\r\nVicki Hawkins\r\nDave McQueen	Hello all,\r\n\r\nAs part of the Sales Activity Management Planning session on April 21st & 22nd, I will be facilitating a MiRo Workshop.\r\n\r\nIn order to communicate, connect & adapt more effectively we firstly need to understand ourselves, and MiRo can help. \r\n\r\nMiRo Behavioural Assessment is an easy way to understand how we view the world and the way that this influences our motivations, fears, styles of communication and methods of leadership.  \r\n\r\nAs a tool for self & team development the MiRo Assessment breaks through the mysteries of preference and help you start the journey of self development for effective performance.\r\n\r\nYou will need to complete the online questionnaire in order for me to raise the reports we will be using when we get together on April 21st.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to seeing you then.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nLinda Jackson\r\nT&D Business Partner\r\n	1	52512	2010-03-26 14:10:29.798	2010-03-26 14:10:29.798	1	1970	1970	Sales Activity Management - MiRo Workshop 	\N	N
