79	Miro Test	Just trialling a few MiRo assessments	In order to make the most out of your programme at Eastnor Castle we need you to take the MiRo Behavioural Mode Indicator. The MBMI assessment is an easy to understand look into how we view the world and the way that this influences our motivations, fears, styles of communication and methods of leadership. By using it you can find ways of meeting your optimum performance when dealing with others. It will take you no more than 10 minutes to complete. And we strongly advise you not to take the assessment with anyone looking over your shoulder as they may influence the way you answer the questions.  It is very important that you answer by how you truly feel about the questions and not how you want to be seen or how others might perceive you to be or want you to be. \r\n\r\nThe results you get from MiRo are always written in a positive way and always follow the rules of;\r\n\r\n•         There are no right or wrong Modes of Behaviour each one is valid given the individual and the environment.\r\n\r\n•         Modes do not relate to skills, ability or knowledge in any way.\r\n\r\n•         No Mode is unhealthy unless used to Excess.\r\n\r\n•         Although we lead with one particular Mode of Behaviour, through conscious effort we have access to all four modes.\r\n\r\nOn the day of the team event you will be handed your MiRo report with a detailed write up of your results. This will be handed directly to you and you alone and you will not be required to show the report to anyone. We will however ask you to share the order in which your behaviours appeared in the report as this will allow you to use the results as a team building tool. The main body of the report ie: the write up will remain confidential to you alone. If anybody has any questions then please do not hesitate to call Kester Wilkinson on 01531 634 066. You can also read an example report which is on the MiRo website.\r\n\r\nTo take the assessment click on the link below and follow the online instructions. \r\n\r\nLogin at: http://www.miro-assessment.com/mirotest\r\n	1	52577	2008-11-06 11:21:48.613	2010-04-14 10:04:57.585	1	1106	1106	Miro assessment	\N	N
