413	Paragon Recruitment Staff	For inclusion in Team Development session at Silverdale on the morning of Wed 16th June. 15min feedback meetings needed with each person prior to that date.	Welcome to the first part of your team development session being facilitated by CPD. \r\n\r\nMiRo Behavioural Mode Assessment, to give it its full name, is a tool that will give you an opportunity to develop your self awareness by reflecting the behaviours that you habitually prefer. I will book an appointment with you to go through your report that will be produced in response to your answers to this online questionnaire.\r\n\r\nSimply click the link and copy and paste your user name and password into the appropriate boxes. Then just follow the onscreen instructions. The assessment will take about 15-20 minutes to complete.\r\n\r\nDuring our workshop on 16th June we will also, with your permission, explore a team map which will plot each person's outline results (not the detail of the report) onto a team diagram. This will aid the further development of your team as you discover what drives each team member.\r\n\r\nThere is no right or wrong answer and so I encourage you not to dwell too long on the questions but to go with your initial reaction. I also encourage you to be completely honest in your answers. \r\n\r\nIt is my experience that sometimes people ask, "I am to reflect on my personal or my professional life?" Although in practice there isn't much difference in the outcome for this assessment, I would ask you to think about your professional life as you answer these questions. \r\n\r\nKind regards, \r\nMark\r\n	1	52899	2010-04-23 12:35:10.051	2010-06-07 06:13:30.89	1	3911	3911	CPD Team Development - MiRo 	\N	N
