501	Capita Consulting People & Organisational Excellence		As you know at the Business Briefing on the 8th October we are running some team building activities and learning.  To aid us with this we require everyone to complete a MiRo Profile. This will allow the various teams and Practice Areas to build on their strengths and understand their diverse nature. To that end please find below your MiRo logon details.  All you need do is click on the link and follow the online instructions.\r\n\r\nIn order to help celebrate Capita Consultings diverse set of behaviours and attributes we will display everyones behaviour graph on a People Wall during the day. Though the main body of the report you receive will remain confidential to you. \r\n\r\nMike Fisher from the P&OE Practice will explain the MiRo profile in more detail on the day and there will also be various other P&OE MiRo practitioners who will be on hand to answer any of your questions.   \r\n\r\nUntil we meet please remember that;\r\n\r\nThere are no right or wrong Modes of Behaviour each one is valid given the individual and the environment.\r\n\r\nModes do not relate to skills, ability or knowledge in anyway.\r\n\r\nNo Mode is unhealthy unless used to Excess.\r\n\r\nAlthough we lead with one particular Mode of Behaviour, through conscious effort we have access to all four Modes.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions please contact Mike Fisher on 07919 298728 or Lesley Bosworth on 07717 003777.\r\n\r\nCan I please ask that you complete your MiRo no later than midday on Friday 24th September. \r\n\r\nMany thanks\r\n\r\nMark Wyllie \r\n	1	53872	2010-09-13 18:32:33.484	2010-09-14 16:08:42.489	1	4702	4702	Capita Consulting Business Briefing 8th October (MiRo Profile)	\N	N
