532	Mandy Delaney		Hi Mandy,\r\n\r\nWelcome to your MiRo Behavioural Mode Assessment. This is a tool that will give you an opportunity to develop your self awareness by reflecting on the behaviours that you habitually prefer. It will give you a flavour of this psychometric and the usefulness of it for Resi.\r\n\r\nSimply click the link and copy and paste your user name and password into the appropriate boxes. Then just follow the onscreen instructions. The assessment will take about 20 -30 minutes to complete and a dictionary may be useful.\r\n\r\nThere is no right or wrong answer and so I encourage you not to dwell too long on the questions but to go with your initial reaction. I also encourage you to be completely honest in your answers. \r\n\r\nIt is my experience that sometimes people ask, "I am to reflect on my personal or my professional life?" Although in practice there isn't much variation between the two, I would ask you to think about your professional life as you answer these questions. \r\n\r\nKind regards, \r\nMark\r\n	1	54160	2010-10-15 11:20:53.126	2010-10-15 11:32:24.728	1	3911	3911	MiRo Psychometrics	\N	N
