1110	Rob Brunton		Hi Rob,\r\n\r\nHere are the login details for you to take your MiRo Behavioural Mode assessment.  \r\n\r\nThe MiRo Behavioural Profile has been designed to give an indication of your behavioural preferences at the time of completing the questionnaire. It is contextual and isn’t intended to label you in any way. The insights it gives are a really helpful tool for personal reflection and development.\r\nMiRo is based on the work of Carl Jung and William Marsden. It looks at the ways in which we interact with our environment, our perceptions and our decision making styles. How we see the world around us and how we chose to deal with it. How we do things. This can affect the way we communicate with others and our effectiveness. \r\nThe results will be sent to you directly and will not be shared with anyone else without your permission.   Please read the instructions carefully and try to be as honest as you can.  \r\n\r\nBest regards, Steve Thom\r\n	1	63184	2015-06-29 14:39:35.867	2015-06-29 14:39:35.867	1	8809	8809	MiRo Behavioural Mode assessment	PO tbc	N
