1269	Offshore Promotion Workshop		In preparation for the leadership and promotion review process workshop being held on the 26th Jan, please can you complete the following MIRO Profile. These will provide key inputs for the running and tailoring of the workshop.	1	64843	2016-01-11 10:25:21.987	2016-01-11 10:25:21.987	1	9564	9564	MIRO Assessment for the Leadership and Promotion Review	PSMM	N
1267	ITEX		Welcome to your MiRo Psychometric.\r\n\r\nMiRo Behavioural Mode Assessment, to give it its full name, is a tool that will give you an opportunity to develop your self-awareness by reflecting on the behaviours that you habitually prefer. \r\n\r\nTo get started simply click the link below and copy and paste your user name and password into the appropriate boxes. Then just follow the onscreen instructions. The questionnaire will take about 20-30 minutes to complete.\r\n\r\nPlease submit your questionnaire no later than Tuesday 12th January. \r\n\r\nThere is no right or wrong answer and so I encourage you not to dwell too long on the questions but to go with your initial reaction. I also encourage you to be completely honest in your answers. \r\n\r\nIt is my experience that sometimes people ask, "Am I to reflect on my personal or my professional life?" Although in practice there isn't much difference in the outcome for this assessment, I would ask you to think about your professional life as you answer these questions. \r\n\r\nIf you have any questions about the completion of the assessment please give me a call on 676076 or email markpayne@thechildrenscentre.org.im\r\n\r\nIn addition to the individual comprehensive Report that you will receive, outline information from your report will be drawn into a Team Report, which we will go through on the Team Development Day.\r\n\r\nKind regards, \r\nMark\r\n	1	64816	2016-01-05 09:48:22.459	2016-01-05 13:32:21.635	1	3911	3911	Your MiRo Psychometric 	N/A	N
1268	Business & Customer Service Team Leader V2	Second lot of reports requested	As part of the selection process for the Business & Customer Service Team Leader role we are inviting shortlisted candidates to complete a MiRo behavioural mode assessment.\r\n\r\nIt takes roughly 10 minutes to complete and requires you to just follow the instructions within the Business & Customer Service Team Leader test.\r\nIf you want to find out more information on the MiRo psychometric tool, please go to http://www.miro-assessment.com/\r\n\r\nAll candidates will have access to their MiRo report after the recruitment process has been completed.\r\n\r\nDeadline for completion is Midday on Wednesday 13th January 2016. \r\n\r\nThe questionnaire should take approximately 10 minutes to complete. \r\nDetails to access the questionnaire are below:\r\n	1	64900	2016-01-08 17:50:37.47	2016-01-12 17:08:24.459	1	9150	9150	Business & Customer Service Team Leader MiRo Assessment 	TBC	N
1263	Microsoft	Alan's son works in Microsoft and is keen to use the profile  	Please find the login and password details to enable you to complete your complimentary VIP enhanced MiRo profile.  \r\n\r\nThe online questionnaire should take no more than 10 minutes to complete. Your profile will then be emailed to you directly	1	64908	2015-12-21 11:39:45.487	2016-01-14 07:41:41.383	1	12710	12710	VIP MiRo login	N/A	N
1270	top up and newbees 21st Jan 2016	ask Gareth!!!!	Thank you very much for agreeing to attend the MiRo practitioner training and top up course scheduled for Thursday 11th and 12th February.\r\n\r\nBelow you will find log in details for you to take a MiRo assessment. I would ask that you complete today if possible, even if you have taken an assessment before. The results will be presented to you on the day as part of the training course.\r\n\r\nJust click on the link below, enter the supplied user name and password into the appropriate fields and follow the online instructions. Try to be as honest as you can (no one will see your responses). If you get stuck it's best to go with your instinct or just think about how someone who knows you very well might answer the question. \r\n\r\nThe whole thing should take no more than 10 minutes or so. Of course if you have any questions please don’t hesitate to get in touch but all being well I will look forward to seeing you next week.\r\n\r\nVery best regards,\r\n\r\nRob Chappell\r\nMiRo Psychometrics	1	65102	2016-01-11 17:05:48.05	2016-02-09 14:05:26.477	1	7166	7166	Your MiRo Assessment log-in	N/A	Y
