277	The Beech Centre ILT March 2016	0	2016-03-22 12:42:49.807	2016-03-22 12:45:03.511	1	9229	9229	40	f	The Beech Centre LT team comprises its directors and the business manager.  The are responsible for the day-to-day running of the business and also the longer terms strategy of becoming the first Institute for Organisational Development in the UK.  The team meets weekly, prepares reports for the monthly Board meeting and leads a monthly meeting of the full Beech team.  It is a relatively new team since the departure of the OD\\Practice Director (Jeremy Lewis) in February and the arrival in January of the Business Development Director Ruth Denwood, who previously worked in the OD Practice.\r\n\r\nThe team has a a leadership contract in place, and the directors hold monthly developmental sessions, where the focus has been on commercialism, taking accountability for performance and pace.\r\n
